<title>USA: Dayton Hudson Corp Q3 Nov 2 oper net up.</title>
<headline>Dayton Hudson Corp Q3 Nov 2 oper net up.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr primary	 $0.51		    $0.18</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $0.49		    $0.18</p>
<p> Oper net		 116,000		   44,000</p>
<p> Revs		   6,073,000		5,573,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     218,800		  217,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     230,700		  229,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 oper results exclude charge of $9.0 million, or $0.04/shr (primary and diluted), for debt redemption.  </p>
<p>Q3 1996 net profit after charge $107.0 million or $0.47 a share primary and $0.45 diluted.</p>
<p>Year-ago period ended October 28, 1995.</p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Oper shr primary	 $1.11		    $0.32</p>
<p> Oper shr diluted	 $1.08		    $0.32</p>
<p> Oper net		 259,000		   83,000</p>
<p> Revs		  17,204,000	     15,556,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary     218,400		  216,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted     230,500		  229,200</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1996 operating results exclude $10.0 million or $0.04 a share primary and diluted charge for debt redemption.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 profit after charge $249.0 million or $1.07 a share primary and $1.04 a share diluted.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
